          "scan_interval": "Update interval",
          "delivered_days": "Keep delivered parcels"
        },
        "data_description": {
          "scan_interval": "Minutes between two updates. Parcello tracks the parcels at the carriers on its own, so a short interval does not make the data more current.",
          "delivered_days": "Days a delivered parcel keeps its sensor after the last tracking event (0 = remove it right away). The parcel stays in the Parcello app until you delete it there."
